=== ch3_intro ===
A crooked tree leans over the path, where everyone walks and nobody stops.
{pimScar: Pim still shares, but now it looks first.}
-> END

=== ch3_bench ===
Now there is a bench under the tree, and a reason to stop.
-> END

=== ch3_warm ===
The same neighbors keep sitting down together, and the village grows warm, one repeat at a time.
-> END

=== ch3_close_call ===
The bench waits under the tree, and the village has not warmed to it yet.
-> END
